  "description": "Only page totals roll into the grand total. :297 inside 1110-WRITE-PAGE-TOTALS is the one and only place WS-GRAND-TOTAL grows, and 1120-WRITE-ACCOUNT-TOTALS (:306-316) has no counterpart - it zeroes WS-ACCOUNT-TOTAL and touches the grand total not at all. Two transactions on one card and a third on another give an account total that differs from the page total, so a translation that rolled account totals in as well would show a grand total of a different value here. The last account's total is never written at all, because the end-of-file arm performs the page and grand totals only.",
